      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\n💰 Money / Invoices\nDashboard — balance, total income, total expenses, active projects, grants count (post-login only, per the\nvisibility rule)\nEntries — money in / money out, logged as invoices\nBudgets — one per project or program\nBourses (grants) — source (INDH / communes / donors), date, method, reason, backed by an approval\ndocument\nFactures & documents — archived against the project\nReports — generated by status + time period, exportable as PDF/Excel",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\n💰 Money / Invoices\nDashboard — balance, total income, total expenses, active projects, grants count (post-login only, per the visibility rule)\nEntries — money in / money out, logged as invoices\nBudgets — one per project or program\nBourses (grants) — source (INDH / communes / donors), date, method, reason, backed by an approval document\nFactures & documents — archived against the project\nReports — generated by status + time period, exportable as PDF/Excel",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
